// Translation and locale-aware formatting.
//
// This package is imported like any other — `import "sngl:i18n"` — and a
// `$"..."` literal needs it in scope: the syntax lowers to a call to `tr`,
// and nothing is ambient but sngl:builtin.
//
// The lowering of $"..." literals targets `tr`. Other entry points are
// direct formatters callable from regular SNGL code.
//
// Each entry point below threads `locale` from the active context into the
// unexported primitive that does the formatting. The wrapper body exists so
// NoContext sees the `locale` read and adds the hidden `__ctx_locale` param
// and the call-site argument that fills it.
